      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>A clear morning in The Arena. I count 15 citizens, each busy in their own way. Zion Truthseeker, a gentle teacher, moves with purpose not far away. The world is lost in pale fog. A crisp silence hangs in the air.</description>
